    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471910/extras/eb98b2ed26f4115919afa4936a52aa69.poster.avif?t=1749832356\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471910/extras/eb98b2ed26f4115919afa4936a52aa69.webm?t=1749832356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471910/extras/eb98b2ed26f4115919afa4936a52aa69.mp4?t=1749832356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Test yourself on the neon lit tracks of Neon Runner. Swerve, jump, and boost your way to the finish line in this retrowave/outrun inspired runner. This fast paced runner style game requires speed and precision to complete all levels as quickly as possible to set a high score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471910/extras/fce0e222c8eb1049184dee2cf122c33f.poster.avif?t=1749832356\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471910/extras/fce0e222c8eb1049184dee2cf122c33f.webm?t=1749832356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471910/extras/fce0e222c8eb1049184dee2cf122c33f.mp4?t=1749832356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 procedurally generated levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright, vibrant neon, Retrowave/Outrun style graphics  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synthwave soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High score leader board</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi